Datum Jelatek Residence or simply known as Datum Jelatek is a mixed-use leasehold development located in Jelatek,Kuala Lumpur. It is a mixed development that is designed to seamlessly blend urban living and modern conveniences, with residential, retail, and commercial elements under one roof. Developed by DatumCorp International Sdn Bhd, the project was completed in 2020 and has seamlessly transitioned itself into the epitome of contemporary living thanks to its upscale facilities, strategic location, and architectural appeal. Datum Jelatek Residence consists of four residential towers with a total of 708 units and a shopping mall, attracting both end-users and investors seeking a high quality of living. The living units are available in options ranging from one - to three-bedrooms. Datum Jelatek Residence will be part of a comprehensive master plan that incorporates retail shops, office space, and recreational areas to create a complete lifestyle destination. Situated in Kuala Lumpur City Centre, the development is easily accessible via major roads and public transportation. The development is also directly connected to the Jelatek LRT station via covered walkway, providing seamless access to the Greater Kuala Lumpur region. The location of Datum Jelatek Residence is one of its main attractions as an investment. This development is only 10 minutes away from the Kuala Lumpur city centre, 5 minutes from Setiawangsa, and is next door to Ampang. The development is directly connected to the Jelatek LRT station via covered walkway, providing easy access to the Greater Kuala Lumpur via public transportation. The mixed development includes a highly integrated street-level retail podium, providing residents with access to a fabulous array of shopping, dining, and entertainment within the project itself. Additional residential amenities include a sky pool and deck, a sky gym with city views, and lushly landscaped outdoor decks for lounging or recreation. Sustainability and eco-friendliness are a main component of Datum Jelatek Residence with its integration of green building technologies and energy-efficient systems, which contribute to significant reductions in operating costs. With such a prime and central location, the development is perfect for city folks who call Datum Jelatek Residence their home, with its excellent and convenient accessibility around Kuala Lumpur. This development is itself adjacent to the Jelatek LRT station, providing seamless connection to public transportation. In lieu of highways, Datum Jelatek Residence is next door to the entry point of the Ampang Kuala Lumpur Express Highway (AKLEH), Middle Ring Road 2 (MRR2) and the major trunk road of Jalan Ampang, providing residents with easy connectivity to key destinations. The area around the development is well matured, offering a plethora of amenities. There is an array of services and amenities, from educational institutions to shopping malls and healthcare facilities. Datum Jelatek Residence redefines urban living with 4 residential towers sitting above a retail podium enveloped by all-encompassing lifestyle facilities. Buyers will get a choice of one - to three-bedroom units, sized from 550 sq ft to 1,600 sq ft. Every unit is designed with contemporary finishes and functionality, open-concept layouts, and large windows. There is a bridge called The Sky Ring is inspired by four lily pads that represent and links the four residential towers, acting as a symbolic ring that links the towers together. It provides a common meeting point for those residing here. The development emphasises sustainability, hence they feature energy-efficient systems, water-saving functions and use of eco-friendly building supplies throughout. The homes feature smart-home technology, where residences can change lighting, temperature control, and monitor their security from within the unit. Datum Jelatek Residence offers a comprehensive range of facilities, designed to cater to the needs of modern urban living: Sky Pool Sky Gym Landscaped Gardens Retail Podium Children’s Playground 24-hour Security Covered Parking These facilities are designed to provide residents with a luxurious and convenient lifestyle, making Datum Jelatek Residence an ideal choice for those seeking a modern, urban living experience. Datum Jelatek Residence is a golden opportunity for buyers who desire to invest in a prime location property in the heart of Kuala Lumpur. It integrates a mix of residential and commercial facilities intended to appeal to everyone from young professionals to families and investors. Located in an area where leading schools and higher education institutions are abundant, the development is perfect for families. Some schools, including the Fairview International School, Sayfol International School, Taylor’s International School, and Mutiara International Grammar School, are just within a stone’s throw of the development. Also nearby are many national schools, providing parents with much choice of education institutions for their offspring. The development is also situated close to various hospitals and health centres such as Gleneagles Hospital Kuala Lumpur which is literally just down the road, and the Ampang Puteri Specialist Hospital – both of which provides top-notch medical services to its patients. Aside from that, Datum Jelatek Residence has it’s own shopping mall which is known as Datum Jelatek Shopping Mall and is surrounded by many shopping spots. This includes easy accessibility to shopping malls like Ampang Point, Great Eastern Mall, and Suria KLCC, where residents will have a diverse selection of shop lots, restaurants, and entertainment facilities to choose from. Set adjacent to a prime location, Datum Jelatek Residence is surrounded by significant landmarks that add to its appeal. Titiwangsa Lake Gardens is a short drive away, where the park has cycling paths, boating facilities, and the National Art Gallery with its varied collection of Malaysian art and cultural events. Located nearby is the KLCC Park which offers a peaceful ambience overlooking the magnificent Petronas Twin Towers. The development is part of DatumCorp International Sdn Bhd's portfolio of high-quality developments. Due to its strategic location, good accessibility and wide range of facilities Datum Jelatek Residence presents as an excellent investment opportunity. Its major selling point is its direct access to the Datum Jelatek LRT station, making it a transit-oriented development (TOD). Additionally, its location which is within close proximity to key business districts, shopping malls and educational institutions only serve to make this development more attractive. And as Kuala Lumpur develops further as a global city, Datum Jelatek Residence is expected to show good capital appreciation in the coming years. Check out the available units for sale at Datum Jelatek Residence, or look a condominium for rent near Datum Jelatek Residence .\n\nProject details\n\nType Service Residence\n\nPrice RM 395K - 2.3M\n\nCompletion year 2022\n\nTenure Leasehold\n\nNo. of blocks 1\n\nTotal units 712\n\n* * *\n\nTop facilities\n\n24-hour security\n\nBasketball court\n\nBbq\n\nCafe\n\n* * *\n\nDeveloper Datumcorp International Sdn Bhd\n\nDatum Jelatek Residence – PropertyGuru Market Pulse Insights\n\nThe project retains a presence in current local search journeys among active property seekers, drawing on 30 days of PropertyGuru search activity. Recent search data shows the project remains relevant to active buyer seekers in the area.\n\nMost-searched Units: 3-Bedroom\nPopular preferences: Gym\nPricing by Unit Types:\n\n  * Studio Units:\n    * Avg Asking Price: RM 650K\n    * Avg PSF: RM 1,167 psf\n    * Available Units: 1\n  * 1-Bedroom Units:\n    * Avg Asking Price: RM 683K\n    * Avg PSF: RM 930 psf\n    * Available Units: 4\nKey Takeaway: Market demand indicators point strongly towards the 3-Bedroom configurations as the preferred choice 